+---
+
+## Request
+
+Implement JSON Pointer (RFC 6901). Export `resolvePointer(document, pointer)` from `src/index.ts`; it
+returns the value the pointer refers to, and throws when the pointer is invalid or does not resolve.
+
+## Work done
+
+- `test/resolve-pointer.test.ts`: 13 tests, written first and failing before the implementation. They
+  cover the RFC 6901 section 5 examples, `~0`/`~1` unescaping, the whole-document pointer `""`,
+  invalid syntax and escapes, invalid and out-of-range indexes (including `-`), missing and inherited
+  members, and traversal into primitives.
+- `src/index.ts`: `resolvePointer` and the `JsonValue` type. Run with `node --test test/resolve-pointer.test.ts`:
+  13 pass, 0 fail.
+- Design choice recorded in dl-001.
